W:1. Guide me, O thou great Jehovah,
W:Pilgrim through this barren land.
W:I am weak, but thou art mighty;
W:Hold me with thy powerful hand.
W:Bread of heaven, feed me till I want no more.
W:Bread of heaven, bread of heaven,
W:Feed me till I want no more.
W:
W:2. Open now the crystal fountain,
W:Whence the healing waters flow;
W:Let the fire and cloudy pillar.
W:Lead me all my journey through.
W:Strong deliverer, be thou still my strength and shield.
W:Strong deliverer, strong deliverer,
W:Be thou still my strength and shield.
W:
W:3. When I tread the verge of Jordan,
W:Bid my anxious fears subside;
W:Bear me through the swelling current,
W:Land me safe on Canaan's side.
W:Songs of praises, I will ever give to thee.
W:Songs of praises, songs of praises,
W:I will ever give to thee.
